        "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix: kill orphaned model servers and stream large run output to disk by @Marina18 in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1924\n* Performance improvements for run/serve/close by @miquelduranfrigola in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1927\n* Friendly errors instead of tracebacks for serve/info/close by @miquelduranfrigola in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1928\n* Make concurrent sessions safe, including the same model in several terminals by @miquelduranfrigola in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1929\n* One consistent, clean style for CLI messages by @miquelduranfrigola in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1930\n* Python API: mirror the CLI and behave like a library by @miquelduranfrigola in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1931\n* Docs: getting started, Python API and CLI reference, built in CI by @miquelduranfrigola in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1932\n* Add GPL-2.0-only to accepted licenses by @TiagoJanela in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1954\n* Add GPL-2.0-or-later to accepted licenses and the model request form by @TiagoJanela in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1957\n* Keep the README's two date sentences apart by @arnaucoma24 in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1946\n* Slim the pip model Dockerfile: no duplicate model layer, one apt laye… by @SoufianeAatab in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1938\n\n## New Contributors\n* @TiagoJanela made their first contribution in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1954\n* @SoufianeAatab made their first contribution in https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/pull/1938\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ersilia-os/ersilia/compare/v0.1.62...v0.1.64",
